%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Parses%20Links%20Notation%20text%20the%20way%20the%20canonical%20reader%20does%20%28comments%20off%29.%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20parseLinoStatements%28source%29%20%7B%0A%20%20try%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20return%20new%20Parser%28%7B%20comments%3A%20false%20%7D%29.parse%28source%29%3B%0A%20%20%7D%20catch%20%28error%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20throw%20new%20LinoSerializationError%28%27parse%27%2C%20error.message%29%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20parseNumber%28value%2C%20message%29%20%7B%0A%20%20if%20%28value%20%3D%3D%3D%20undefined%20%7C%7C%20value%20%3D%3D%3D%20null%20%7C%7C%20%21%2F%5E%5Cd%2B%24%2F.test%28String%28value%29%29%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20throw%20structureError%28message%28value%29%29%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%20return%20Number%28value%29%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20parseLinkId%28value%29%20%7B%0A%20%20try%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20if%20%28typeof%20value%20%21%3D%3D%20%27string%27%20%7C%7C%20%21%2F%5E%5Cd%2B%24%2Fu.test%28value%29%29%20throw%20new%20TypeError%28%27invalid%20numeric%20token%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20return%20LinkId.from%28value%29.asU64%28%29%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%20catch%20%7B%20throw%20structureError%28%60invalid%20link%20id%20%5C%60%24%7Bvalue%7D%5C%60%60%29%3B%20%7D%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%0A%20%2A%20Decodes%20canonical%20statements%20into%20%60%7B%20id%2C%20references%2C%20metadata%2C%20registered%20%7D%60%0A%20%2A%20records.%20Throws%20%60LinoSerializationError%60%20on%20the%20same%20inputs%20Rust%27s%0A%20%2A%20%60LinkNetwork%3A%3Afrom_lino%60%20rejects.%0A%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20decodeCanonicalStatements%28statements%29%20%7B%0A%20%20const%20records%20%3D%20%5B%5D%3B%0A%20%20for%20%28const%20statement%20of%20statements%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20if%20%28statement.id%20%3D%3D%3D%20null%20%7C%7C%20statement.id%20%3D%3D%3D%20undefined%20%7C%7C%20statement.values.length%20%3D%3D%3D%200%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20throw%20structureError%28%27top-level%20statement%20must%20be%20an%20identified%20link%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%