(27199: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %2F%2F%20Translates%20meta-language%27s%20own%20modules%20between%20JavaScript%2C%20TypeScript%20and%0A%2F%2F%20Rust%20through%20meta-language%20links.%20The%20source%20is%20parsed%20losslessly%20with%20its%0A%2F%2F%20native%20grammar%3B%20a%20translation%20into%20the%20same%20language%20writes%20the%20links%20back%0A%2F%2F%20byte%20for%20byte%2C%20and%20a%20translation%20into%20the%20other%20language%20translates%20each%0A%2F%2F%20top-level%20item%20the%20portable%20core%20can%20express%20and%20carries%20every%20other%20item%0A%2F%2F%20verbatim%20in%20a%20marked%20comment.%20Both%20kinds%20of%20item%20keep%20their%20source%20as%0A%2F%2F%20provenance%2C%20so%20translating%20an%20unedited%20translation%20back%20restores%20the%0A%2F%2F%20source%20byte%20for%20byte.%0Aimport%20%7B%20createHash%20%7D%20from%20%27node%3Acrypto%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20isDeepStrictEqual%20%7D%20from%20%27node%3Autil%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7BplanOwnedRecursiveDeclarationPublication%7D%20from%20%27.%2Ftranslation%2Frecursive-declaration-ownership.js%27%3B%0A%0Aimport%20%7B%20decoratorSet%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Fdecorators.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20decorateEmitted%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Fgrammar-emitters%2Fcommon.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20LinkNetwork%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Fnetwork.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20ParseConfiguration%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Fprimitives.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20parseProgrammingLanguage%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Fprogramming-language-parser.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20acceptSelfTranslationUtf16Member%2C%20requireSelfTranslationUtf16Representation%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Fself-translation-representation-rules.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20checkProgram%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Ftranslation%2Fcheck.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20TranslationError%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Ftranslation%2Fdiagnostics.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20emitJavaScript%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Ftranslation%2Femit-javascript.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20emitRust%2C%20emitRustConstants%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Ftranslation%2Femit-rust.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20parseJavaScript%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Ftranslation%2Fjavascript.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20requiresReferenceSemantics%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Ftranslation%2Freference-analysis.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20tokenize%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Ftranslation%2Flexer.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20eraseTypeScript%2C%20requiresTypeScriptErasure%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Ftypescript-erasure.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20projectTypeScriptTyping%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Ftypescript-portable-typing.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20parseRust%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Ftranslation%2Frust.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20acceptBindingScope%2C%20acceptLiteralBinding%2C%20acceptModuleBindingScope%2C%20acceptRootSyntaxItem%2C%20acceptSourcePrefixRestoration%2C%20acceptSourceEnvelopeRestoration%2C%20acceptDeclarationSignature%2C%20findBindingRunEnd%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Ftranslation%2Ffrontend-rules.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7BrequireSelfTranslationLayoutEnvelope%7D%20from%20%27.%2Fself-translation-layout-rules.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7BreadDeferredDeclarationBinding%7D%20from%20%27.%2Ftranslation%2Fdeferred-declaration-scope.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20readDeclarationDependencyComponents%2C%20acceptRecursiveDeclarationGroup%2C%0A%20%20acceptRecursiveDeclarationPublication%2C%20acceptDeclarationModuleScope%2C%0A%20%20acceptDeclarationSignatureBinding%2C%20acceptDeclarationDeferredModuleScope%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Ftranslation%2Fdeclaration-dependency-rules.js%27%3B%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20The%20languages%20self-translation%20reads%20and%20writes.%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20const%20SELF_TRANSLATION_LANGUAGES%20%3D%20Object.freeze%28%5B%27JavaScript%27%2C%20%27TypeScript%27%2C%20%27Rust%27%5D%29%3B%0A%0Aconst%20HEADER%20%3D%20%27%2F%2F%20meta-language%3Aself-translation%3Av1%20%27%3B%0Aconst%20CARRIED%20%3D%20%27%2F%2F%20meta-language%3Acarried%20%27%3B%0Aconst%20TRANSLATED%20%3D%20%27%2F%2F%20meta-language%3Atranslated%20%27%3B%0Aconst%20SOURCE_LINE%20%3D%20%27%2F%2F%20%7C%27%3B%0Aconst%20PRELUDE_BEGIN%20%3D%20%27%2F%2F%20meta-language%3Aprelude%20begin%27%3B%0Aconst%20PRELUDE_END%20%3D%20%27%2F%2F%20meta-language%3Aprelude%20end%27%3B%0A%2F%2F%20Portable-core%20Rust%20keeps%20the%20source%27s%20parentheses%20and%20names.%0Aconst%20RUST_ALLOW%20%3D%20%27%23%21%5Ballow%28unused%2C%20unreachable_patterns%2C%20non_snake_case%2C%20non_camel_case_types%2C%20invalid_nan_comparisons%29%5D%27%3B%0Aconst%20ALIASES%20%3D%20new%20Map%28%5B%0A%20%20%5B%27javascript%27%2C%20%27JavaScript%27%5D%2C%20%5B%27js%27%2C%20%27JavaScript%27%5D%2C%20%5B%27mjs%27%2C%20%27JavaScript%27%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5B%27typescript%27%2C%20%27TypeScript%27%5D%2C%20%5B%27ts%27%2C%20%27TypeScript%27%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5B%27rust%27%2C%20%27Rust%27%5D%2C%20%5B%27rs%27%2C%20%27Rust%27%5D%2C%0A%5D%29%3B%0Aconst%20COMMENTS%20%3D%20new%20Set%28%5B%27comment%27%2C%20%27line_comment%27%2C%20%27block_comment%27%5D%29%3B%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Thrown%20for%20an%20unknown%20language%20or%20a%20source%20the%20links%20do%20not%20reproduce.%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20class%20SelfTranslationError%20extends%20Error%20%7B%0A%20%20constructor%28message%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20super%28message%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20this.name%20%3D%20%27SelfTranslationError%27%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20The%20self-translation%20language%20%60language%60%20names%2C%20or%20%60null%60.%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20selfTranslationLanguage%28language%29%20%7B%0A%20%20return%20ALIASES.get%28String%28language%29.toLowerCase%28%29%29%20%3F%3F%20null%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20required%28language%29%20%7B%0A%20%20const%20name%20%3D%20selfTranslationLanguage%28language%29%3B%0A%20%20if%20%28%21name%29%20throw%20new%20SelfTranslationError%28%60self-translation%20reads%20and%20writes%20%24%7BSELF_TRANSLATION_LANGUAGES.join%28%27%2C%20%27%29%7D%2C%20not%20%24%7Blanguage%7D%60%29%3B%0A%20%20return%20name%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2F%20The%20family%20a%20language%27s%20code%20is%20written%20in%3A%20TypeScript%20items%20are%20read%20and%0A%2F%2F%20written%20as%20JavaScript.%0Aconst%20family%20%3D%20%28language%29%20%3D%3E%20%28language%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27Rust%27%20%3F%20%27Rust%27%20%3A%20%27JavaScript%27%29%3B%0Aconst%20sha256%20%3D%20%28text%29%20%3D%3E%20createHash%28%27sha256%27%29.update%28Buffer.from%28text%2C%20%27utf8%27%29%29.digest%28%27hex%27%29%3B%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%0A%20%2A%20Translates%20%60source%60%20from%20%60sourceLanguage%60%20to%20%60targetLanguage%60%2C%20each%20one%20of%0A%20%2A%20%7B%40link%20SELF_TRANSLATION_LANGUAGES%7D%20or%20an%20alias%20of%20one.%0A%20%2A%0A%20%2A%20The%20result%20is%20%60%7B%20sourceLanguage%2C%20targetLanguage%2C%20code%2C%20items%20%7D%60.%20Each%20item%0A%20%2A%20%60%7B%20term%2C%20start%2C%20end%2C%20status%2C%20reason%20%7D%60%20is%20a%20top-level%20item%20of%20the%20source%0A%20%2A%20%28byte%20offsets%29%20with%20its%20status%3A%20%60kept%60%20%28same%20language%29%2C%20%60translated%60%2C%0A%20%2A%20%60restored%60%20%28provenance%20gave%20back%20its%20source%29%2C%20%60comment%60%2C%20%60provenance%60%20%28a%0A%20%2A%20self-translation%20header%20or%20prelude%29%20or%20%60carried%60%2C%20with%20the%20reason%20it%20was%0A%20%2A%20carried.%0A%20%2A%0A%20%2A%20%60options.decorators%60%20%28a%20DecoratorSet%20or%20an%20array%20of%20decorators%29%20decorates%0A%20%2A%20each%20translated%20item%20at%20the%20%60emitter%60%20level%2C%20one%20%60%7B%20format%2C%20number%2C%20line%20%7D%60%0A%20%2A%20record%20per%20line%20of%20its%20definitions%20with%20the%20target%20language%20as%20%60format%60%2C%0A%20%2A%20before%20its%20provenance%20is%20recorded%2C%20so%20a%20translation%20can%20be%20brought%20to%20match%0A%20%2A%20hand-written%20code%20and%20still%20restores%20its%20source.%0A%20%2A%0A%20%2A%20From%20JavaScript%20or%20TypeScript%20into%20Rust%2C%20an%20item%20may%20call%20and%20read%20the%0A%20%2A%20module%27s%20other%20top-level%20items%3A%20each%20item%20is%20translated%20after%20the%20items%20it%0A%20%2A%20names%2C%20with%20the%20signatures%20of%20those%20that%20translated%20boun